<h1>Video generation failed ❌</h1>

<p>
  Hi <%= @user.name %> — unfortunately every output for
  <strong><%= @video.title %></strong> in project <strong><%= @project.name %></strong>
  failed to generate. No charge was completed for failed outputs. You can retry
  from the portal.
</p>

<h2>Outputs</h2>
<ul>
  <% @outputs.each do |output| %>
    <li><%= output[:label] %> — <%= output[:status] %></li>
  <% end %>
</ul>

<p>Retry generation here:</p>
<p><a href="<%= @generation_url %>"><%= @generation_url %></a></p>
